<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 59 0 R
/T (Echo Garden illustrates Life on Land \(SDG 15\) by using pollination as a metaphor for human ecological responsibility. Showing how individual and community activities impact ecosystem health. Transforming abstract sustainability concepts into an immersive narrative experience. Moreover, the storyboard visualise these ideas without the need for a physical exhibit, illustrating the cause and effect links between visitor behaviour and environmental effects.)
/E (Echo Garden illustrates Life on Land \(SDG 15\) by using pollination as a metaphor for human ecological responsibility. Showing how individual and community activities impact ecosystem health. Transforming abstract sustainability concepts into an immersive narrative experience. Moreover, the storyboard visualise these ideas without the need for a physical exhibit, illustrating the cause and effect links between visitor behaviour and environmental effects.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
