180 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 59 0 R
/T (Echo Garden brings participant movement to life within a digital meadow. Each visitor becomes a pollinator, providing visible and audible feedback on the direct impact of their actions. The exhibit focus on the importance of collaboration and attention in biodiversity, asking visitors to consider how their own behaviour affects ecosystems. At last, participants exits with a better understanding of their role in sustaining life on land.)
/E (Echo Garden brings participant movement to life within a digital meadow. Each visitor becomes a pollinator, providing visible and audible feedback on the direct impact of their actions. The exhibit focus on the importance of collaboration and attention in biodiversity, asking visitors to consider how their own behaviour affects ecosystems. At last, participants exits with a better understanding of their role in sustaining life on land.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
