182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 59 0 R
/T (Working on it inspired our team to think in new ways about how to plan interactive experiences. We had learned how a digital ecosystem works and were beginning to appreciate the impact of what visitors do when they click around. We were working with people who could help us understand that our choices would matter. As we drew the storyboard and mapped the user flow, we could more easily translate our concepts into pictures. Creating the storyboard helped us understand how interactive design, storytelling and sustainability could enter the equation in a real-world project.)
/E (Working on it inspired our team to think in new ways about how to plan interactive experiences. We had learned how a digital ecosystem works and were beginning to appreciate the impact of what visitors do when they click around. We were working with people who could help us understand that our choices would matter. As we drew the storyboard and mapped the user flow, we could more easily translate our concepts into pictures. Creating the storyboard helped us understand how interactive design, storytelling and sustainability could enter the equation in a real-world project.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
